            "value": "<h2><strong>AUTOMATED ORDER REVIEW WORKFLOW WITH ANOMALY DETECTION</strong></h2><p><strong>Purpose:</strong></p><p>Automate Salesforce order processing while detecting anomalies,</p><p>validating critical invoicing fields, and routing exceptions for review.</p><p><strong>Workflow Steps</strong></p><p><em>1. Fetch Order</em></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Retrieve order from Salesforce</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Mark status as Processing</p><p><em>2. Anomaly Detection</em></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Score order using Isolation Forest model</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Flag unusual orders for visibility and auditing</p><p><em>3. Invoice Validation</em></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Validate PO Number, Billing Details, Contact, Pricebook, Amount</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;• Validate Contract for high-value orders</p><p><em>4. Decision Routing</em></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;✓ Validation Passed</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Push Order to Dynamics 365</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Mark as Successfully Processed</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;✗ Validation Failed</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Mark as Waiting Approval</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Route to Human Reviewer</p><p><em>5. Human Approval Path</em></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;✓ Approved</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Mark as Manually Approved</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Push Order to Dynamics 365</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;✗ Rejected</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Mark as Validation Failed</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Send Remediation Email</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→ Request Salesforce Data Correction</p><p><strong>Final Outcomes</strong></p><p>• Successfully Processed</p><p>• Manually Approved &amp; Processed</p><p>• Validation Failed</p><ul><li>• Anomaly Score Generated For Audit &amp; Monitoring</li></ul><p><br></p>",
            "widget": "textarea_rich",
